    "detailed_description": "Guided by the moon's lost treasure, uncover the true history.<br><br><strong>Story Synopsis</strong><br>One day, after a great typhoon had passed, a boy holding the moon's lost treasure arrived at a village by a beautiful lake.<br><br>Prompted by a miraculous encounter in the miniature garden, the boy and the village girls set off on an adventure to find the &quot;lost treasure.&quot;<br><br>No one knows that they are stepping into a place where a hidden history sleeps. With the key in hand, they begin their journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/6f168cb96674710ec2e0e865f2c3dfd3.poster.avif?t=1748867941\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/6f168cb96674710ec2e0e865f2c3dfd3.webm?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/6f168cb96674710ec2e0e865f2c3dfd3.mp4?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The mysterious scale dropped by the moon. Guided by it, the boy weaves a tale by joining hands with others.<br>This is a story of following the luminous memories leading to legends and reclaiming the lost form of the moon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/ad48ddaf65f14b135161eeaacb38eb4b.poster.avif?t=1748867941\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/ad48ddaf65f14b135161eeaacb38eb4b.webm?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/ad48ddaf65f14b135161eeaacb38eb4b.mp4?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/29346e67baac308dd94581a3c3bf3386.poster.avif?t=1748867941\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/29346e67baac308dd94581a3c3bf3386.webm?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/29346e67baac308dd94581a3c3bf3386.mp4?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Features of this game</strong><br>This game is a visual novel where you experience the adventure of spirits, woven from the mysterious scale dropped by the moon. Yoni and Nelun, who live in the lakeside town, meet a boy guided by the moon's scale and follow the path of a lost legend. As players progress through the game, they relive the story of reclaiming the moon's lost form.<br><br><strong>Elements included in the game</strong><br>\u30fbAnimation<br>\u30fbMystical world<br>\u30fbAn adventurous story with deep human drama<br>\u30fbA story that connects the past and present<br>\u30fbSpirits<br>\u30fbWaterside creatures",
    "about_the_game": "Guided by the moon's lost treasure, uncover the true history.<br><br><strong>Story Synopsis</strong><br>One day, after a great typhoon had passed, a boy holding the moon's lost treasure arrived at a village by a beautiful lake.<br><br>Prompted by a miraculous encounter in the miniature garden, the boy and the village girls set off on an adventure to find the &quot;lost treasure.&quot;<br><br>No one knows that they are stepping into a place where a hidden history sleeps. With the key in hand, they begin their journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/6f168cb96674710ec2e0e865f2c3dfd3.poster.avif?t=1748867941\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/6f168cb96674710ec2e0e865f2c3dfd3.webm?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/6f168cb96674710ec2e0e865f2c3dfd3.mp4?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The mysterious scale dropped by the moon. Guided by it, the boy weaves a tale by joining hands with others.<br>This is a story of following the luminous memories leading to legends and reclaiming the lost form of the moon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/ad48ddaf65f14b135161eeaacb38eb4b.poster.avif?t=1748867941\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/ad48ddaf65f14b135161eeaacb38eb4b.webm?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/ad48ddaf65f14b135161eeaacb38eb4b.mp4?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/29346e67baac308dd94581a3c3bf3386.poster.avif?t=1748867941\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/29346e67baac308dd94581a3c3bf3386.webm?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742410/extras/29346e67baac308dd94581a3c3bf3386.mp4?t=1748867941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Features of this game</strong><br>This game is a visual novel where you experience the adventure of spirits, woven from the mysterious scale dropped by the moon. Yoni and Nelun, who live in the lakeside town, meet a boy guided by the moon's scale and follow the path of a lost legend. As players progress through the game, they relive the story of reclaiming the moon's lost form.<br><br><strong>Elements included in the game</strong><br>\u30fbAnimation<br>\u30fbMystical world<br>\u30fbAn adventurous story with deep human drama<br>\u30fbA story that connects the past and present<br>\u30fbSpirits<br>\u30fbWaterside creatures",
